<title>UK: World Bank sets 400 million Danish crown bond.</title>
<headline>World Bank sets 400 million Danish crown bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-09-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager Svenska Handelsbanken.</p>
<p> BORROWER   WORLD BANK</p>
<p> AMT    400 MLN DKR   COUPON     6.375     MATURITY    14.MAR.03</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  101.535   PAY DATE  L-15.NOV.96</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.75	REOFFER    =	   L-LONG FIRST COUPON</p>
<p> MOODY	AAA	 LISTING    LUX	 PAY FREQ    =</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  AAA	 DENOMS (K) 10-100    SALE LIMITS US/UK</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   IPMA 2</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   HOME CTRY  SUPRA     TAX PROVS   =</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.50	SELL CONC  1.25	PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p> NOTES	ISSUED UNDER GLOBAL MULTI-CURRENCY PROGRAMME</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
